using Finance.Core.Time;
using Finance.Pricing.Rates;
using Finance.Pricing.Credit;
using Finance.Visualization;

#!markdown

## Bootstrapping the curve / Bootstrap kurva

**EN.** Short maturities come from deposits, the 6×12 point from an FRA, the long end from par swap rates. Each instrument is repriced exactly by the bootstrapped curve.

**ID.** Jatuh tempo pendek berasal dari deposito, titik 6×12 dari FRA, dan ujung panjang dari suku bunga par swap. Setiap instrumen dinilai ulang secara tepat oleh kurva hasil bootstrap.

#!csharp

var instruments = new ICurveInstrument[]
{
    new DepositInstrument(0.25, 0.0530), new DepositInstrument(0.5, 0.0525),
    new FraInstrument(0.5, 1.0, 0.0500),
    new SwapInstrument(2, 0.0465), new SwapInstrument(3, 0.0440), new SwapInstrument(5, 0.0420),
    new SwapInstrument(7, 0.0415), new SwapInstrument(10, 0.0418), new SwapInstrument(20, 0.0430), new SwapInstrument(30, 0.0425),
};
var curve = CurveBootstrapper.Bootstrap(instruments);
Console.WriteLine("Max repricing error: " + instruments.Max(i => Math.Abs(i.PricingError(curve))).ToString("E2"));
var tenors = Enumerable.Range(1, 60).Select(i => i * 0.5).ToArray();
var zeros = tenors.Select(t => curve.ZeroRate(t)).ToArray();
var forwards = tenors.Select(t => curve.ForwardRate(t, t + 0.5)).ToArray();
var nss = NelsonSiegelSvensson.FitSvensson(tenors, zeros);
Console.WriteLine($"Svensson fit: β0={nss.Beta0:F4} β1={nss.Beta1:F4} β2={nss.Beta2:F4} β3={nss.Beta3:F4} τ1={nss.Tau1:F2} τ2={nss.Tau2:F2}");
display(HTML(Charts.Line(new[]
{
    new LineSeries("Zero rate", zeros) { Color = "#6366F1" },
    new LineSeries("6M forward", forwards) { Color = "#FBBF24" },
    new LineSeries("Svensson fit", tenors.Select(t => nss.ZeroRate(t)).ToArray()) { Color = "#2DD4BF", Dash = "5 4" },
}, new ChartOptions { Title = "Bootstrapped curve (inverted front end)", XLabel = "Years", YFormat = "P2", Height = 340 }, x: tenors)));

#!markdown

## Bond analytics / Analitik obligasi

**EN.** A 10-year 4.5% semi-annual bond. Modified duration is the % price change for a 1% yield move; convexity is the second-order correction; DV01 is the price change for one basis point.

**ID.** Obligasi 10 tahun kupon 4,5% semesteran. Durasi termodifikasi adalah perubahan harga dalam % untuk perubahan yield 1%; konveksitas adalah koreksi orde kedua; DV01 adalah perubahan harga untuk satu basis poin.

#!csharp

var settle = new DateOnly(2025, 3, 17);
var bond = new FixedRateBond(new DateOnly(2025, 1, 15), new DateOnly(2035, 1, 15), 0.045, frequency: 2);
var a = bond.Analytics(0.0430, settle);
Console.WriteLine($"Clean {a.CleanPrice:F4}  dirty {a.DirtyPrice:F4}  accrued {a.AccruedInterest:F4}");
Console.WriteLine($"YTM {a.YieldToMaturity:P3}  Macaulay {a.MacaulayDuration:F3}  modified {a.ModifiedDuration:F3}  convexity {a.Convexity:F2}  DV01 {a.Dv01:F4}");
double up = bond.CleanPrice(0.0430 + 0.01, settle) - a.CleanPrice;
double approx = -a.ModifiedDuration * 0.01 * a.DirtyPrice + 0.5 * a.Convexity * 0.0001 * a.DirtyPrice;
Console.WriteLine($"+100bp: exact {up:F3}, duration+convexity approximation {approx:F3}");
Console.WriteLine($"Price off the curve {bond.DirtyPrice(curve, settle):F4}; Z-spread at clean 99.00 = {bond.ZSpread(curve, 99.0, settle) * 1e4:F1} bp");

#!markdown

## Swaps and swaptions / Swap dan swaption

**EN.** A 5-year payer swap at 4.00% has positive value when the par rate is higher. A 1y×5y payer swaption is priced with Black's model on the forward swap rate.

**ID.** Payer swap 5 tahun pada 4,00% bernilai positif bila suku bunga par lebih tinggi. Payer swaption 1y×5y dinilai dengan model Black atas forward swap rate.

#!csharp

var swap = new InterestRateSwap(Notional: 10_000_000, FixedRate: 0.04, Maturity: 5, PayFixed: true);
Console.WriteLine($"Par rate {swap.ParRate(curve):P3}  NPV {swap.Npv(curve):N0}  DV01 {swap.Dv01(curve):N0}");
var swaption = new Swaption(Expiry: 1, Tenor: 5, Strike: 0.042, Payer: true, Notional: 10_000_000);
Console.WriteLine($"Forward swap rate {swaption.ForwardSwapRate(curve):P3}; Black (20% vol) {swaption.PriceBlack(curve, 0.20):N0}; Bachelier (90bp) {swaption.PriceBachelier(curve, 0.009):N0}");
var frn = new FloatingRateNote(Maturity: 3, Frequency: 4, QuotedMargin: 0.008);
Console.WriteLine($"3y FRN (+80bp) price at 50bp discount margin: {frn.Price(curve, discountMargin: 0.005):F4}");

#!markdown

## Credit default swaps / Credit default swap

**EN.** Market CDS spreads imply a hazard (default-intensity) curve. With 40% recovery, the "credit triangle" says hazard ≈ spread / (1 − R). The protection buyer's NPV is protection leg minus premium leg.

**ID.** Spread CDS pasar menyiratkan kurva hazard (intensitas gagal bayar). Dengan recovery 40%, "segitiga kredit" menyatakan hazard ≈ spread / (1 − R). NPV pembeli proteksi adalah leg proteksi dikurangi leg premi.

#!csharp

double[] maturities = { 1, 3, 5, 7, 10 };
double[] spreads = { 0.0060, 0.0085, 0.0110, 0.0125, 0.0140 };
var hazard = CreditDefaultSwap.BootstrapHazard(curve, maturities, spreads, recovery: 0.4);
for (int i = 0; i < maturities.Length; i++)
    Console.WriteLine($"{maturities[i],4}y spread {spreads[i] * 1e4,5:F0}bp → hazard {hazard.Hazards[i]:P2} (triangle {CreditDefaultSwap.CreditTriangleHazard(spreads[i]):P2}), survival {hazard.SurvivalProbability(maturities[i]):P1}");
var cds = new CreditDefaultSwap(Notional: 10_000_000, Spread: 0.0100, Maturity: 5);
Console.WriteLine($"5y CDS at 100bp: par spread {cds.ParSpread(curve, hazard) * 1e4:F1} bp, NPV (protection buyer) {cds.Npv(curve, hazard):N0}, risky duration {cds.RiskyDuration(curve, hazard):F3}");
